yHISTORY OF THE UNIVERSE:

g   THE DUNGEONS OF THE UNFORGIVEN
ARE LOCATED SOMEWHERE NEAR AN OLD
PLANET NAMED EART. MOST RESIDENTS
OF THE DUNGEONS BELIEVE THAT THEY
LIVE ON A PLANET, BUT MORE HIGHLY
EDUCATED CREATURES BELIEVE THAT
THEY LIVE WITHIN SOME SHIP OR
STRUCTURE OF SOME SORT.

r   IT IS BELIEVED THAT THE DUNGEONS
WERE POPULATED BY THE MANY SPECIES
THAT ONCE LIVED IN HARMONY ON EART.
THE DUNGEONS WERE SOME KIND OF
OUTPOST THAT APPARENTLY SURVIVED THE
FOOLISH RACE-WARS THAT WERE INSPIRED
BY THE HUMANS. NON-HUMAN CREATURES
AT FIRST COULD NOT UNDERSTAND WHY
HUMANS HELD SUCH HATRED FOR OTHER
RACES. THEN THIS HATRED SPREAD UNTIL
EVERY GROUP HATED EVERY OTHER GROUP.

b   AFTER THE WARS, ETHNO-CENTRIC
IDEOLOGY SPREAD TO OTHER SPECIES,
AND THE DUNGEONS WERE DIVIDED INTO
SEPARATE REGIONS INHABITED BY GROUPS
OF SIMILAR CREATURES.

